{#
   Club Spotlight — every 12h, one of the 5 most active clubs (minimum
   ClubSpotlightService::MIN_SYNC_COUNT valid syncs in the window) is featured here.
   Entirely client-rendered from data attributes (same technique as the
   Chairman's Terminal ticker's club badges): kit/badge via the existing
   composeKitSvg()/clubBadgeIconsHtml(), owner avatar and top performer avatar
   via composePlayerSpriteSvg() (avatar-compositor.js), stadium via the newly
   ported composeStadiumSvg() (stadium-compositor.js). All three scripts must
   load before landing.js — see base.html.twig.

   spotlight is the cached ClubSpotlight singleton (App\Entity\ClubSpotlight),
   refreshed by app:spotlight:generate — never computed live here. Before the
   first cron run, every field is null/empty and the section renders nothing
   (empty clubName).

   Gated on spotlight.isLive(), i.e. windowEndsAt still in the future — not on
   clubName alone. The card says "FEATURED THIS CYCLE" and the note promises a
   12-hourly pick, so a row left behind by a stopped cron (or by a long run of
   cycles where nobody cleared MIN_SYNC_COUNT) must drop out rather than keep
   advertising a cycle that ended days ago. A quiet cycle where the incumbent
   is still the most active club does NOT hide the section —
   ClubSpotlightService::selectNew() re-ups the window for exactly that case.

   trophies is the club's honours board — SeasonRecord finalPosition=1 counts
   grouped by league tier, with the trophy artwork read live off the League row
   for (club country, tier) at generation time. establishedAt is Club::$createdAt;
   there is no separate founding date server-side. Both are null/empty on rows
   written before those columns existed, and both degrade to simply not rendering.

   Career earnings shows dividendDrawsPence (real UserLedger DIVIDEND_DRAW
   entries against this club), not Club::$totalCareerEarnings — the latter is
   every income source the club has ever had, not money the owner has
   actually drawn out. See ClubSpotlightService::selectNew().

   topPerformer* is a goals+assists-ranked proxy, not a literal "rating" —
   there's no persisted per-player match rating anywhere server-side (see
   PlayerCareerStatRepository::findTopPerformerForClub()). Its avatar only
   renders if the player has ever reported a sync v2 appearanceConfig —
   most haven't yet, since no client consumes this field today.
#}
{% if spotlight.isLive %}
<section class="spotlight-section" id="spotlight">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-label">Club Spotlight</div>
        <div class="spotlight-card"
             data-owner-appearance="{{ spotlight.ownerAppearance|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
             data-stadium-config="{{ spotlight.stadiumConfig|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
             data-performer-appearance="{{ spotlight.topPerformerAppearanceConfig|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
             data-club-badge="{{ {home: spotlight.homeKitConfig, away: spotlight.awayKitConfig, badge: spotlight.badgeConfig}|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}">
            <div class="spotlight-header">
                <span class="pixel">FEATURED THIS CYCLE</span>
                <div class="spotlight-badge-kit">
                    <span class="spotlight-badge-slot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="spotlight-club-name">{{ spotlight.clubName }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="spotlight-pitch">
                <figure class="spotlight-owner" style="margin:0;">
                    <span class="spotlight-owner-slot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <figcaption class="spotlight-pitch-label">Owner</figcaption>
                </figure>
                <figure class="spotlight-stadium" style="margin:0;">
                    <span class="spotlight-stadium-slot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                </figure>
                {% if spotlight.topPerformerName is not empty %}
                    <figure class="spotlight-owner" style="margin:0;">
                        <span class="spotlight-performer-slot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        <figcaption class="spotlight-pitch-label">{{ spotlight.topPerformerName }}</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                {% endif %}
            </div>

            <div class="spotlight-footer vt">
                <span>Owner: <strong>{{ spotlight.ownerName ?? 'Anonymous' }}</strong></span>
                {% if spotlight.establishedAt %}
                    <span>Established: <strong>{{ spotlight.establishedAt|date('M Y') }}</strong></span>
                {% endif %}
                <span>Reputation: <strong>{{ spotlight.clubReputation|number_format }}</strong></span>
                <span>Dividends Drawn: <strong>£{{ (spotlight.dividendDrawsPence / 100)|number_format }}</strong></span>
            </div>

            {#
               Honours board. The trophy silhouettes are black SVGs recoloured with a
               CSS filter chain — the exact chains are lifted verbatim from the admin
               leagues screen (templates/admin/leagues_content.html.twig), the one
               other place these assets are rendered; keep the two in step.
               brightness(0) normalises to black, invert(1) flips to white, then
               sepia+saturate+hue-rotate applies the target colour.

               trophyImage is nullable on League (an admin may simply not have set one),
               so a tier can carry real titles and no artwork — those still appear, as
               a count-only chip. Dropping them would under-report real silverware.
            #}
            {% if spotlight.trophies is not empty %}
                {% set TROPHY_FILTERS = {
                    'silver':      'brightness(0) invert(0.72) saturate(0) brightness(1.15) contrast(1.05)',
                    'gold':        'brightness(0) invert(1) sepia(1) saturate(6) hue-rotate(8deg) brightness(0.82)',
                    'gold_silver': 'brightness(0) invert(1) sepia(0.7) saturate(3) hue-rotate(8deg) brightness(0.9)'
                } %}
                <div class="spotlight-trophies">
                    <div class="spotlight-detail-title">
                        Trophies Won
                        <span class="spotlight-trophy-total">{{ spotlight.totalTrophies }}</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="spotlight-trophy-list">
                        {% for trophy in spotlight.trophies %}
                            <li class="spotlight-trophy"
                                title="{{ trophy.leagueName ?? 'Tier ' ~ trophy.tier }} — {{ trophy.titles }} {{ trophy.titles == 1 ? 'title' : 'titles' }}">
                                {% if trophy.trophyImage %}
                                    <img class="spotlight-trophy-img"
                                         src="/images/trophies/{{ trophy.trophyImage }}.svg"
                                         alt=""
                                         loading="lazy"
                                         style="filter: {{ TROPHY_FILTERS[trophy.trophyColour] ?? 'none' }};">
                                {% endif %}
                                <span class="spotlight-trophy-meta">
                                    <span class="spotlight-trophy-count">&times;{{ trophy.titles }}</span>
                                    <span class="spotlight-trophy-tier">{{ trophy.leagueName ?? 'Tier ' ~ trophy.tier }}</span>
                                </span>
                            </li>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </ul>
                </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if spotlight.recentFixtures is not empty or spotlight.recentTransfers is not empty %}
                <div class="spotlight-detail-grid">
                    {% if spotlight.recentFixtures is not empty %}
                        <div class="spotlight-detail-col">
                            <div class="spotlight-detail-title">Recent Fixtures</div>
                            <ul class="spotlight-detail-list">
                                {% for fixture in spotlight.recentFixtures %}
                                    <li>
                                        <span class="spotlight-result-badge is-{{ fixture.result|lower }}">{{ fixture.result }}</span>
                                        vs {{ fixture.opponent }}
                                        <span class="spotlight-detail-sub">{{ fixture.scoreFor }}–{{ fixture.scoreAgainst }} · Wk {{ fixture.week }}</span>
                                    </li>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if spotlight.recentTransfers is not empty %}
                        <div class="spotlight-detail-col">
                            <div class="spotlight-detail-title">Recent Transfers</div>
                            <ul class="spotlight-detail-list">
                                {% for transfer in spotlight.recentTransfers %}
                                    <li>
                                        <span class="spotlight-result-badge is-{{ transfer.direction == 'in' ? 'w' : 'l' }}">{{ transfer.direction == 'in' ? 'IN' : 'OUT' }}</span>
                                        {{ transfer.playerName }}
                                        <span class="spotlight-detail-sub">£{{ (transfer.feePence / 100)|number_format }} {{ transfer.direction == 'in' ? 'from' : 'to' }} {{ transfer.counterpartyClub }}</span>
                                    </li>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
        <p class="spotlight-note">Picked at random every 12 hours from the most active clubs — keep syncing and build something worth featuring.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<hr class="divider">
{% endif %}
